  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Title: Legal and Human Rights Centre &#x2013; Strategic Plan 2025-2030: A Just and Equal Society, Where Rights are Recognised, Respected and Upheld. Objective: The overall mission of LHRC is to promote and protect human rights and foster a society where rights are recognised, respected and upheld. The organization works to achieve this mission through a focus on four strategic objectives: (a) improved legal and policy environment, (b) reduced incidences of violence and discrimination against women, children and people living with disability, (c) enhanced accountability of duty bearers to address citizen&#x2019;s needs and concerns, (d) efficient, effective and sustainable LHRC.</narrative>
  </description>
